EternaCity_TowerA_3F_Text_BadgesFromGyms:
	.string "Badges from Gyms, or Contest wins...\n"
	.string "There’s more than just one way to\p"
	.string "be a winner, it seems.\n"
	.string "Here’s hoping you’ll find something\p"
	.string "in which you can be the victor.$"

